0020:     - For a rectangle of height h and width w, stamp the same rectangle at offsets (h, -w), (2h, -2w), ... and (h, w), (2h, 2w), ...
0021:     - Drop only the out-of-bounds part of any stamped rectangle and stop once a trajectory is fully outside the grid.
0022: 
0023:     Key insight
0024:     - Each rectangle is both the sprite and the stride: its height controls the downward step and its width controls the sideways step.
